NODE id=matrix/router/internal/db.DB.RedeemInviteCode kind=method
  digest=b3:315d16b0b9787ea6c1ef88f0c44c371e302b244fa8dd5ebcbf3c98365eb9b23a file=router/internal/db/beta.go range=121:189 lang=go exported=true byte_range=3452:5468
  sig=func (d *DB) RedeemInviteCode(ctx context.Context, code, userID string) error
  doc=RedeemInviteCode atomically validates + consumes one redemption of the\ngiven code for the given user. It checks:\n  - the code exists\n  - the code has not expired\n  - redemptions remain (used < max)\n  - the user has not already redeemed this code\n\nOn success it increments redemptions_used and inserts an\ninvite_redemptions row in a single transaction. On any failure no\nredemption is consumed.
EDGES
